{"v":4,"catch":"Pirate Treasure: Island of Mazes 是一款精彩的益智遊戲，你需要幫助海盜走出一個可憐的迷宮。","desc":"遊戲具有運動控制功能，因此你必須使用控制台的陀螺儀來嘗試解決難題。 有大量的謎題可供選擇，所以你最終會一直玩得很開心。\n\n由於有數十個關卡可供選擇，你總能享受到獨特而身臨其境的遊戲體驗。 此外，你可以測試自己的解謎技巧並在進行過程中提高它們。 今天就親自來看看吧！\n\n特徵：\n- 運動控制拼圖\n- 數十個關卡等你來玩\n- 美麗的海盜主題\n- 引人入勝的有趣遊戲\n- 很多重玩價值","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2022-01-13","genres":["街機","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/882d27efc71a33089e0ad1e7fe7cad1952045f07abed9b3c35da3bd2a1d30681.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/51143b40bd8c73e8690e35a3c38641300d13ed48bed6d9444fc27fe3ba3cf8d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f3ffb87a839fa1478e3fca2f4e972f01f690eb5b2f18c99f84d5df892c87433.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c2f52d5a3a3c8080e045e915f1cf3736f493668075c7a1878b3fd3ce32f659c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/726ba56e2c87045c2283739903053fee32dbd6758be446a5c781d710e72fccd8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2cd38ccf293bb643bdc8e13a5e69b8859f41cdf5687fb17dba0de48bb7982810.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d9e0163ae000","dlc":[]}